.TH WERKMEISTER-REGISTRY 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-registry \- Regenerate ~/.werkmeister/services.yaml from every \e<repo>/.werkmeister/services.yaml under paths.repos_root (merged under ~/.werkmeister/services.local.yaml)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister registry\fR [action]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-check\fR
Report drift without writing; nonzero exit when stale.
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Regenerates \fB~/.werkmeister/services.yaml\fR from every repo's \fB.werkmeister/services.yaml\fR fragment under \fBpaths.repos_root\fR, merged under \fB~/.werkmeister/services.local.yaml\fR. It is the same step \fBwerkmeister setup\fR runs, on its own: use it after cloning a new repo.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
werkmeister registry            # regenerate (sync is the default action)
werkmeister registry \-\-check    # report drift; nonzero exit when stale
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
